[{"objectID":"test:test.com:root.uv.overview-chunk:0","org_id":"test","domain":"test.com","canonicalPathname":"/","pathname":"/","title":"Ferry Health API","breadcrumb":[],"visible_by":["role/everyone"],"authed":false,"page_position":0,"type":"markdown","content":"The Ferry Health API provides programmatic access to Appointment Tasks.\nUse the API to:\nCreate Appointment Tasks\n\nLoad Appointment Tasks"},{"objectID":"test:test.com:root.uv.overview-authentication-chunk:0","org_id":"test","domain":"test.com","canonicalPathname":"/","pathname":"/","title":"Authentication","breadcrumb":[],"visible_by":["role/everyone"],"authed":false,"page_position":1,"type":"markdown","hash":"#authentication","content":"To use the Ferry API, you'll need an API key. If you don't have one already, please\nreach out to get one: support@ferry.health.\nIn all API requests, you should provide your token using the Authorization\nheader with the \"Bearer \" prefix:","code_snippets":[{"lang":"json","code":"\"Authorization\": \"Bearer <YOUR TOKEN>\""}],"hierarchy":{"h0":{"title":"Ferry Health API"},"h2":{"id":"authentication","title":"Authentication"}},"level":"h2"},{"objectID":"test:test.com:root.uv.overview-appointment-tasks-chunk:0","org_id":"test","domain":"test.com","canonicalPathname":"/","pathname":"/","title":"Appointment Tasks","breadcrumb":[],"visible_by":["role/everyone"],"authed":false,"page_position":1,"type":"markdown","hash":"#appointment-tasks","content":"You can create Appointment Tasks to initiate a search for providers. See the\n/create-appointment-task endpoint for the\navailable request properties.\nWhen you create an Appointment Task, we will return an appointmentTaskId, and Ferry will asynchronously\ncompile a list of providers with validated availability. You can poll for the status of a task using\nthe /get-appointment-task endpoint.\nOnce the task is in the \"AVAILABLE\" state, it will include some appointment availabilities:","code_snippets":[{"lang":"json","meta":"Available Task","code":"{\n  \"appointmentTaskId\": \"ferry.task-appointment.a3327c6c-1cc2-4f56-a137-6c457550a04e\",\n  \"status\": \"AVAILABLE\",\n  \"patient\": {\n    \"firstName\": \"Jane\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Smith\",\n    \"sex\": \"Female\",\n    \"dateOfBirth\": \"1980-01-01\",\n    \"homeAddress\": \"123 Happy Lane, New York, NY 11211\",\n    \"insurancePlan\": \"Aetna - Managed Choice Open Access\",\n    \"memberId\": \"123456\"\n  },\n  \"results\": {\n    \"appointmentAvailabilities\": [\n      {\n        \"provider\": {\n          \"npi\": \"1234567890\",\n          \"firstName\": \"Jane\",\n          \"lastName\": \"Smith\"\n        },\n        \"location\": {\n          \"name\": \"Louisville Health Center\",\n          \"address\": \"123 Happy Lane, Louisville KY 01234\"\n        },\n        \"nextAvailableAppointments\": [\n          \"2024-09-15T12:00:00.000Z\",\n          \"2024-09-18T14:00:00.000Z\",\n          \"2024-09-20T11:45:00.000Z\"\n        ],\n        \"availabilityNotes\": \"Scheduling 2 weeks out\",\n        \"reasonForInclusion\": \"CLOSEST_LOCATION\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"}],"hierarchy":{"h0":{"title":"Ferry Health API"},"h2":{"id":"appointment-tasks","title":"Appointment Tasks"}},"level":"h2"},{"objectID":"test:test.com:b20d860e-c8a8-4c88-96b3-61f801a57f31.CreateAppointmentTask","org_id":"test","domain":"test.com","canonicalPathname":"/api-reference/appointment-tasks/create-appointment-task","pathname":"/api-reference/appointment-tasks/create-appointment-task","title":"Create Appointment Task","breadcrumb":[{"title":"API Reference","pathname":"/api-reference"},{"title":"Appointment Tasks","pathname":"/api-reference/appointment-tasks"}],"visible_by":["role/everyone"],"authed":false,"page_position":0,"api_type":"http","api_definition_id":"b20d860e-c8a8-4c88-96b3-61f801a57f31","api_endpoint_id":"endpoint_.CreateAppointmentTask","distinct":"endpoint_.CreateAppointmentTask","method":"POST","endpoint_path":"/api/v1/appointment-tasks/crea